              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naabukorere da aokot nuka Sitepan ekajenanikon, ajai eoŋ da abwoi eapie, ketojokite, kedari inapen luka lukearete ŋes.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
